{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e851ad5daf473ef587dc9d07026f0217e222b3889e8d2718de7741fd794f4854", "ja": "（今日は劇場の定期公演。\nもうすぐ、歩の新曲お披露目公演が始まる）", "zh": "（今天是剧场的定期公演。马上就要开始步的新曲揭幕公演了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c699a278b4d643cae72f53f7430719b272e5ba3a1423dc7813d1ed3e18494fb7", "ja": "歩、準備できたって聞いたけど。\nいけるか？", "zh": "听说步已经准备好了。\n没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9d2de348810d8b5908f2592c04e155e8dbfd1ee3129e788b6a935fad9a8af3ca", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nうん、いつでもいけるよ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n嗯，随时都可以出发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f240a0eccca2163d1ba571d6078baa4752be331fc4cd23551bf278497fe3cf2c", "ja": "その衣装、よく似合ってるよ。\n歩のための衣装だな。", "zh": "那套服装很适合你。\n是为步量身定做的服装呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "baea921ed2240fcb394578781fcde66f3dc68fb4cef0cf8e6b9ba4b7a90a81f9", "ja": "へへっ、ありがと♪\nカッコイイ衣装で、アタシもうれしいよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢♪\n能穿上这么帅气的服装，我也很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e45b88b37762657b91d1929f1f8ff03b8aa5646bc0b5612eb3485eb7affba52f", "ja": "よし、それじゃ移動しようか。\nみんな待ってるぞ！", "zh": "好，那我们过去吧。\n大家都在等着呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9c0f95b06d07c0e60e704fcb98f730ff59986c12d30da73d3838727889addac4", "ja": "あ、ちょっと待って！　その前に……\n{$P$}に、伝えたいことがあって。", "zh": "啊，等一下！在那之前……\n我有话想对{$P$}先生说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c959886142a4ad6f8c9779e4e873d0b3e662f46a09a5746b8271eca701913a91", "ja": "{$P$}。いつもアタシのために\nステキな衣装を用意してくれて、サンキュー！", "zh": "{$P$}。谢谢你总是为我准备漂亮的服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3217d8f5c40ad9b3ff84198e578114b69983b1265d74027ca80ce2d300ed2a18", "ja": "そんな、お礼なんていいけど……どうしたんだ？", "zh": "不用道谢啦……你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "45fb82bd9ea975362704d1cd0254f5f5c6a3bbf43fdc2021382aa017c5a48f31", "ja": "うん。なんか、改めて考えてさ……アタシは今、\n自分が憧れた『アイドル』なんだってこと。", "zh": "嗯。就是，突然重新想到了……自己现在，\n已经是曾经憧憬过的“偶像”了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "82fdd54cb39c68981f6e73a42b35cc8d0db7b99f2c3e3aa02a3c4954ed709482", "ja": "これまで{$P$}が用意してくれた\n衣装は、どれもキラキラ輝いてたけど……。", "zh": "一直以来，{$P$}为我准备的服装，每一件都闪闪发光，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d4884ee026d3f1660f1e3d0d6cd64688fd650a62ceb096ce1373e9f5bde5de48", "ja": "時々、心の中で立ち止まることがあったんだ。自分は\n本当に、この衣装に……アイドルに相応しいのかって。", "zh": "有时候，我会在心里停下来想一想。自己是否真的……配得上这身衣装……配得上偶像这个身份。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d0625207a1bcd1746ae2ba58858eb9e39ec669b03a89d557bc37790e6d0267a5", "ja": "歩……。", "zh": "步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0197e4d2a7655d366c5d9039ad703fa32832c217f794faaf259657d86ec62b32", "ja": "でも、今回やっと思えたんだ。\nアタシは、アタシのためにも……。", "zh": "但是，这次我终于想明白了。\n我也要为了自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2638070696aea767f9270b856ed6e3467dc88e565d169ced2871cfbc12a8be32", "ja": "それから、応援してくれる人たち。仲間や、\nファンのみんなのためにも……アイドルでいる！", "zh": "还有，那些一直支持我的人们。为了伙伴们，还有粉丝们……我也要继续当偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8b2669d576abb56dd408401ebf553e697642e283c6c25bd8cf8e69b05419d7ed", "ja": "だから、えっと……と、とにかく、\n{$P$}ありがとう！ってコト！", "zh": "所以，那个……总、总之，就是要说声“谢谢你，{$P$}”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1016_p", "source_sha256": "bf0a101e18c8342d812555c9121bb82c8360d0d1a5fa03389fedc8925e95f464", "ja": "そう言ってくれるのは嬉しいけど、歩がアイドルに\nなれたのは、歩自身が頑張ってきたからだよ。", "zh": "你能这么说我很开心，不过，步能成为偶像，也是因为她自己一直努力到现在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e39908225cbfefe86a903fe6c574cb31600bbc45d0d9d735ddac04a1ae73e4a1", "ja": "もちろん、自分でもがんばったけど！　でも\nプロデューサーも、すっごく大事な仕事だろ？", "zh": "我自己当然也很努力啦！不过\n制作人也是非常重要的一份工作吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c8e21b29e5df9b10ee7266f76799a7aaaaebf56472d400282670e11ae88baae5", "ja": "だから今までの分も、\nちゃんとお礼を言いたいなって思って……。", "zh": "所以，我想把至今为止的那份谢意，也好好地向你表达出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1019_p", "source_sha256": "b062fe1efbad1b593bec0d4958a5ef2ff4f724326150692dd6c9c7454acb3712", "ja": "どういたしまして。これからも、もっともっと\n歩が輝けるようにサポートしていくよ。よろしくな！", "zh": "不用客气。今后我也会继续支持，让步更加闪耀。请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4a0469be60eefdfc14831cfdd4a4b426f51aa8525dfe464fe51f3d540c626c03", "ja": "そうこなくっちゃ♪\n一緒にがんばろう、{$P$}！", "zh": "这样才对嘛♪  \n一起加油吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "69239747aad6660701f75215757aa7332f1c96fcf9d6fa55199d7bf3d7f9b527", "ja": "アタシ、今はまだまだだけど……大きくなるよ！\n絶対、世界でナンバーワンのアイドルになってみせる！", "zh": "我现在还差得远着呢……但我会成长起来的！\n绝对要成为世界第一的偶像给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0274_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "73646bddb6b12b02745117180e8140a34979e9c90e98c2a51639977d4569c8d9", "ja": "その時は……舞台袖で、\nハイタッチの準備しといてよね！　イェーイッ♪", "zh": "到那时候……你可要在舞台侧台准备好和我击掌哦！耶——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
